ds on the repo layout fails the test. Importing the\nbackend outside Hermes needs a stub `agent.delegation_provider` module in\n`sys.modules`. Run Python with `-B`; otherwise it writes `__pycache__/`\nfolders, which are not gitignored. Delete any before committing.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PEYV49hUbnaynPqGLGzBtt","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
