{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChFYQFRnpRtVPE6HGL2Fw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01P4CthDGCnyXMiynRWDSMRM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> AGENTS.md <<'EOF'\n\nThe backend's `register(ctx)` registers both the delegation provider and\nthe skill (`ctx.register_skill(\"tiiny-model-routing\", <dir>/SKILL.md)`),\nso Hermes serves the skill from the plugin directory. Renaming or moving\n`SKILL.md` means changing `SKILL_PATH` in `__init__.py`.\n`test/test_register.py` calls `register` with a recording fake `ctx` on a\ncopied tree; run it with `python3 -B test/test_register.py`.\nEOF\npython3 -B test/test_register.py 2>&1 | tail -1; python3 -B test/test_installed_tree.py 2>&1 | tail -1; find . -name __pycache__ -not -path './node_modules/*'; grep -n lint package.json\nmkdir -p .redeye && cat > .redeye/notes.md <<'EOF'\n# Ticket 04 notes: backend registers the skill\n\n## Implemented\n- `tiiny-router/__init__.py`: `SKILL_NAME`/`SKILL_PATH`\n  (`Path(__file__).resolve().parent / \"SKILL.md\"`); `register(ctx)` now\n  also calls `ctx.register_skill(SKILL_NAME, SKILL_PATH)` (positional,\n  since the spec gives only the method name; no external API research).\n- `test/test_register.py` (seam 2, unittest, standalone): copies the tree\n  to a temp path, runs a probe subprocess that stubs\n  `agent.delegation_provider`, calls `register` with a recording fake\n  ctx, prints calls as JSON. Fake `register_skill` accepts name/path\n  positionally or by keyword.\n- `SKILL.md`: requirements bullet now says the skill ships in the plugin\n  and resolves as `tiiny-router:tiiny-model-routing`. Broader rewrite of\n  vault/symlink text is left to the docs ticket.\n- AGENTS.md: note on register() and the test.\n- Not wired into `npm test` (ticket says 05 does that).\n\n## Items\n1. Exactly one delegation provider: already true before this ticket; the\n   test passed on first run (documents existing behaviour, not red-first).\n2. Skill named tiiny-model-routing: red then green.\n3. Skill path inside copied plugin dir: red then green; asserts the path\n   is a file named SKILL.md under the copy's resolved root.\n- Committed as one commit: items 2 and 3 share the same one-line change,\n  and the test file could not be committed red.\n\n## For next attempt / later tickets\n- If real Hermes `register_skill` uses a different signature (e.g. keyword\n  names or a description arg), adjust the call and the fake ctx together.\nEOF\ngit add -A test/test_register.py tiiny-router/__init__.py tiiny-router/SKILL.md AGENTS.md && git commit -qm \"Routing backend registers the skill from the plugin directory\" && git status --short"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1094,"cache_read_input_tokens":59614,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1094},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ca3e715-3c01-431a-a919-59dde8f9f1f8","uuid":"aee76d56-54e5-422e-a1a6-54410fe62b42","timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:44:36.214Z","request_id":"req_011ChFYQFE8RMJbPuBqteTJj","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01P4CthDGCnyXMiynRWDSMRM":{"command":"cd /Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-04-backend-registers-skill && cat >> AGENTS.md <<'EOF'\n\nThe backend's `register(ctx)` registers both the delegation provider and\nthe skill (`ctx.register_skill(\"tiiny-model-routing\", <dir>/SKILL.md)`),\nso Hermes serves the skill from the plugin directory. Renaming or moving\n`SKILL.md` means changing `SKILL_PATH` in `__init__.py`.\n`test/test_register.py` calls `register` with a recording fake `ctx` on a\ncopied tree; run it with `python3 -B test/test_register.py`.\nEOF\npython3